  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">ArtWeek</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3705 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-news tag-artweek tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3705\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"548\" height=\"410\" alt=\"©Robin Litwin, Bartletts on Turquoise\" src=\"/media/archive/f80ded191ea06dad5823e53a34595e7ffcc2468dfb0b265fcd12dea007e11e93.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Robin Litwin Demonstrates Encaustic Painting for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-05T20:28:18-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 5, 2018, 8:28 pm\">April 5, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>New member of The Guild of Harwich Artists, Robin Litwin is a Harwich artist and photographer. In 2008, she retired from a 25-year career teaching in the Art Department at <a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3684 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-artweek tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-kathleen-magnusson tag-larry-folding tag-lydia-bell tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-yvette-stenzel\" id=\"post-3684\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman painting with watercolors at a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/00421df83ff95b315a4308f2588b50a921d82bd450400bc624f11b2de9128f5b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">April Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-03T01:06:43-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 3, 2018, 1:06 am\">April 3, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>April Meetings: Executive Board Meeting:  Monday, April 9, 2018, 9:30a.m. at Harwich Chamber of Commerce Board Room, 1 Schoolhouse Road, Harwich Port Gallery Meeting:  Saturday, April 21, 2018, 12:30 p.m <a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3651 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-doris-mee tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3651\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"373\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a woman wearing a black and white hat.\" src=\"/media/archive/17ba029536948e62bf6a0907464342d5f36869dc57b5336b7278ea8365129815.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\" rel=\"bookmark\">ArtWeek Demonstrator, Doris Mee</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-29T19:21:45-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, March 29, 2018, 7:21 pm\">March 29, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists, as part of the upcoming ArtWeek festival happening April 27 – May 6, presents a Meet the Artist demonstration featuring master <a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3631 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3631\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-season-kicks-off-early-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist Season Kicks Off Early for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-25T13:32:43-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, March 25, 2018, 1:32 pm\">March 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Special for ArtWeek, two demonstrations will kick off  the 2018 season at The Gallery of Harwich Artists. Larry Folding will demonstrate a Cape Cod painting in watercolor on April 28 <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-season-kicks-off-early-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3624 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-larry-folding tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3624\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-larry-folding/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"699\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Watercolor of boats in a harbor.\" src=\"/media/archive/e21ef111eda49963eaa1adeb180581895295fc7e88eca9280b93ec1e8e5005f3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-larry-folding/\" rel=\"bookmark\">ArtWeek Demonstrator, Larry Folding</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-25T13:06:07-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, March 25, 2018, 1:06 pm\">March 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Come see a master artist, Larry Folding, create a watercolor painting of Provincetown Fishing Boats at a free demo on Saturday, April 28 from 2 to 4 PM at The <a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-larry-folding/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
